description:
InserJeunes collects data on the vocational route, from the CAP level to the BTS level, and makes it possible to calculate, for each apprentice training centre and for each vocational high school, when the number of staff concerned is sufficient:
- the employment rate 6 months after leaving the institution;
- the added value of the establishment;
- the rate of continuation of studies;
- the rate of interruption during training;
- the share of contracts interrupted before expiry.

