This table provides data on early school leaving (annual accrual) from secondary education (VET), secondary vocational education (VET) and general secondary adult education (VET) to: 
- type of education;
- student's level of income;
- group of origin;
- age;
- gender.
Please note: This publication provides insight into the background characteristics of early school leavers compared to non-early school leavers. This publication is therefore not intended to reflect the total number of early school leavers in the Netherlands.

