The specific objectives of the National Vocational Training Plan are:
• Increasing the level of training of people belonging to disadvantaged groups, focusing on the following target groups: 
- young people under 25 years of age;
- persons over 45 years of age;
- long-term unemployed;
- women;
- persons with disabilities;
- Roma;
- people from rural areas.
• increasing the participation of jobseekers in training, in particular the long-term, hard and very hard-to-work unemployed;
